  "generationPrompt": "Create one low-angle orthographic-isometric north-south 1x2 traversable forest staircase, matching the camera angle of the reference battle map rather than a straight top-down ladder. Show a broad lower landing in the foreground, four or five wide earthen treads reinforced by thick gnarled roots, and a visibly higher rear landing. The connected silhouette must run diagonally upward through pivot/anchor (128,128), with readable tread faces and enough width for combat units. Keep all pixels inside drawBounds and the exterior transparent. No narrow ladder, repeated oval rungs, perfectly vertical top-down strip, opaque backing rectangle, bridge, cliff wall, isolated roots, freestanding prop, or cast shadow.",
